{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Let stand alive before YHWH.</b> Its standing is alive before YHWH, and its death is by being pushed. Until when does he need it to remain alive? Rabbi Yehuda says: until he has made atonement, as it is stated: וכלה מכפר את הקדש ואת אהל מועד ואת המזבח, והקריב את השעיר החי (and he shall finish making atonement for the holy place and the tent of meeting and the altar, and he shall bring the live goat)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:12:43.994769237Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}